<InfoPage title="About SpicyBox Guide" kicker="About this publication" description="An independent editorial guide to the SpicyBox AI image-to-video generator, uploads, templates, credits, privacy, safety, and alternatives."><h2>Our purpose</h2><p>We help adults evaluate intimate AI media tools before sharing an image, identity data, or money. Coverage focuses on workflow, source-image consent, output quality, privacy, deletion, credit economics, and useful alternatives.</p><h2>Independence</h2><p>This is not the official SpicyBox product and is not operated by or endorsed by its provider. Official links are marked and open spicy-box.com. This site does not accept photos or run a generator.</p><h2>Editorial method</h2><p>Every article answers a specific decision, distinguishes published product claims from editorial judgment, cites primary sources, and shows publication and review dates. Changing features and prices require verification on the live product.</p></InfoPage>
